Package: net.metering
Title: Net Metering Data by U.S. Utility, 2011-2024
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jesus", "Felix De Los Reyes","Humberto" ,"jfelixdlr@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a monthly panel dataset on net metering activity by 
    U.S. electric utility from 2011 to 2024. Includes energy sold back to 
    utilities by residential net metering customers (solar and wind), installed net 
    metering capacity, enrolled customer counts, utility revenue and sales, 
    electricity pricing, net energy generation payment structures (retail, 
    avoided cost, feed-in tariff), and local income and climate conditions 
    (temperature, radiation, cloud coverage) within each utility's service 
    boundaries. Source data compiled from the U.S. Energy Information 
    Administration (EIA), U.S. Census Bureau, Copernicus Climate Data Store, 
    and NCEP-DOE AMIP-II Reanalysis.
